      "self_resolved": [
        "Scope is the command surface only; R3, R4, R6, R10, R11 and issue #14 keep everything beneath it (D1)",
        "FR-004 is stale against ADR 0002 and is rewritten to the layered configuration model (D2)",
        "FR-017 is narrowed to external addresses; the command's own docstring was overstating it (D3)",
