        "A redirect does not fail the check, by accident rather than design, and is now specified to be reported (D5)",
        "Interrupt exit code is unified to 130 in every mode (D6)",
        "A malformed pyproject.toml is a ConfigError per ADR 0008, not a traceback (D7)",
        "Two dead configuration paths are removed (D8)",
        "The django and project-directory mechanisms are documented as CLI behaviour; which settings module loads is R6's (D9)",
        "Live-server rebuild/reload/browser behaviour is out of scope, upstream's contract (D10)",
        "Success criteria rewritten from wall-clock thresholds to decidable states (D11)"
      ]
    },
